# Hospital Medical Record
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Hospital — a visit's clinical record; Notes is sensitive, visible only to
# the treating Clinician, first real case evidence for field-level visibility
# (CAP-P06, previously spec-example only). Clinical decision support (drug
# interaction checks, dosage limits) is explicitly out of scope — domain-engine
# territory, same boundary Study 6 drew for posting derivation.
# Case 20 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: hospital-patient.menata, hospital-appointment.menata

Medical Record

Fields

- Patient : Patient
- Appointment : Appointment
- Visit Date : Date
- Diagnosis : Rich Text
- Notes : Rich Text
- Prescriptions : Table of (Drug Name, Dosage, Frequency, Duration)
- Created By : User

Constraints

- Patient is required.
- Visit Date is required.
- Diagnosis is required.

Permissions

Clinician

- Create
- View

Views

- Record Form : Form
- Patient History : List
- Record Detail : Detail
